# Project context

This is a public-data explorer for a frontend portfolio. It is not a diagnostic, treatment, or recommendation tool.

- Show search, filters, sorting, pagination, list and detail, and a chart when the screen calls for them.
- Every data screen has loading, empty, and error states.
- Use only aggregate, study, or regulatory public data. Never identifiable patients or PHI.
- Name the source on the screen and say what the numbers are not.
- At most three public APIs in v1. Prefer open CORS and an honest response shape.
- v1 sources are ClinicalTrials.gov and CDC PLACES. Do not add WHO GHO until a proxy exists.
- README and LinkedIn copy stay in plain language and never sound like medical advice.
